    "[What evidence proves transformation succeeded?]"
   ]
  ],
  "id": "B0035"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "",
  "text": "Transformation thesis",
  "id": "B0036"
 },
 {
  "type": "table",
  "rows": [
   [
    "Complete this sentence  If we change [capabilities / journeys / operating model], then [customer/operational outcomes] will improve, which will create [financial/strategic benefits], because [evidence / causal logic]."
   ]
  ],
  "id": "B0037"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "",
  "text": "Scope sanity check",
  "id": "B0038"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "List Bullet",
  "text": "Is scope tied to outcomes rather than departments?",
  "id": "B0039"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "List Bullet",
  "text": "Can each major scope item be traced to a diagnosed problem or opportunity?",
  "id": "B0040"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "List Bullet",
  "text": "Are explicit exclusions documented?",
  "id": "B0041"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "List Bullet",
  "text": "Is the baseline measurable?",
  "id": "B0042"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "List Bullet",
  "text": "Are executive decisions required to unblock the transformation visible?",
  "id": "B0043"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "",
  "text": "PHASE 2",
  "id": "B0044"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "",
  "text": "02  DEFINE — North Star & Outcomes",
  "id": "B0045"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "",
  "text": "Objective: translate the case for change into measurable transformation outcomes that can steer portfolio and operating-model choices.",
  "id": "B0046"
 },
 {
  "type": "para",
  "level": 0,
  "style": "",
  "text": "Outcome hierarchy",
  "id": "B0047"
 },
 {
  "type": "table",
  "rows": [
   [
    "Level",
    "Definition",
    "Example"
   ],
   [
    "North Star",
    "Concise description of the desired future business state.",
    "“Make roaming effortless, trusted and economically accretive.”"
   ],
   [
    "Strategic Outcomes",
    "What must improve for the North Star to be true.",
    "Revenue growth, activation, customer experience, partner economics."
   ],
   [
    "KPIs",
    "Measures proving outcome movement.",
    "Roaming revenue, attach rate, complaint rate, digital activation."
   ],
   [
    "Targets",
    "Time-bound ambition.",
    "+X% revenue by Q4; -Y% complaints."
   ],
   [
    "Initiative Contribution",
    "How each initiative moves one or more outcomes.",
    "New pass architecture → attach rate + ARPU."
   ]
  ],
  "id": "B0048"
 },
